/target
*.log
# Local catalog + ingest/live state written by ls-ingest and the tester binaries.
/catalog
# Local data home (catalog, runs/, decisions/, probes/) used by the README recipes.
/data
# Credential-derived spend ledger (KTD-3): keyed by hashed appkey, never tracked.
# The turn scripts pin LS_SPEND_LEDGER_FILE here so it survives across fresh homes.
/state
# Active KRX calendar snapshot + candidate/diff artifacts (U15 publication boundary,
# KTD9): the production snapshot is approved-user-local, owner-readable (installed 0o600),
# and license-restricted — no KRX-derived rows are ever committed. Covered by /state above;
# this explicit entry guards a snapshot placed anywhere at the workspace root too.
/calendar-snapshots
*.calendar.json
*.calendar.json.candidate
*.calendar.json.candidate.diff.json
# Owner-local calendar bulk-fetch artifacts (U4, KTD9): the normalized-inputs artifact + the
# resumable 0o600 checkpoint. Confined beneath the owner-local state root (already gitignored via
# /state); these suffix guards catch a copy placed anywhere at the workspace root too.
*.calendar-inputs.json
*.calendar-fetch.ckpt

/*.lock
!Cargo.lock
